					<h3>Will & Document Review</h3>
					<p>We carefully review the Will, death certificate and estate details to ensure the probate application
                       is accurate, complete and ready for lodgement with the NSW Supreme Court. We guide executors through 
                       the process, helping to avoid unnecessary delays in obtaining the Grant of Probate and Administering the estate.</p>
                    </a>
